EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Well, hello{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
If it isn't {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Today is the
{{TAG:0000:0003:0200}}Winter Solstice{{TAG:0000:0003:FFFF}}, you know.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
This day of darkness only happens
once a year!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}If you think about how
special it is,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} it feels less gloomy!

